{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Token Limits for Network AI Output.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Token Limits for Network AI Output.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"token limits for network ai output token limits for network ai output","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Token Limits for Network AI Output.md","fileName":"Token Limits for Network AI Output.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Token Limits for Network AI Output","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Network AI Model and Prompt Engineering]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Token Limits for Network AI Output.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Token Limits for Network AI Output.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"token limits for network ai output token limits for network ai output","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Token Limits for Network AI Output.md","fileName":"Token Limits for Network AI Output.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Token Limits for Network AI Output","heading":"Token Limits for Network AI Output","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An output-token limit caps how much text a model may generate. A low limit controls cost and prevents runaway responses, but it can cut off a configuration, checklist, or explanation before the artifact is complete. A truncated answer may still look syntactically polished at its beginning.\n\nThe limit should reflect the requested format and the task's worst plausible size. Callers must inspect the completion status and reject unfinished output rather than treating it as a full method of procedure. For long interactive responses, [[Streaming Network AI Response]] improves visibility but does not remove the limit.","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Token Limits for Network AI Output.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Token Limits for Network AI Output.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"token limits for network ai output token limits for network ai output","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Token Limits for Network AI Output.md","fileName":"Token Limits for Network AI Output.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Token Limits for Network AI Output","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}